---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Reviews | 7 Days to Die Cheats" description="How Days Cheats handles product feedback and review publication."><section class="pt-28 pb-20 md:pt-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5"><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-primary">Feedback policy</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-5xl font-bold uppercase">Reviews</h1><div class="mt-8 space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-7 text-muted-foreground"><p>We do not publish anonymous, purchased, or unverifiable customer testimonials. There are currently no independently verified reviews displayed on this page.</p><p>For help with a merchant purchase, use the merchant’s support channel and retain your order details. Product feedback should be specific, respectful, and backed by a verifiable purchase where possible.</p><a class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-primary-foreground" href="/support/">Get support information →</a></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
